    "create_time": 1785467763.65,
    "update_time": 1785467768.115041,
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "**2+ weeks out (now)**\n- [ ] Decide ship vs. sell for each item. Usually sell/donate: mattress, kitchen basics, desk. Ship: monitor (if > $200), keyboard, bike (if good), clothes.\n- [ ] Bike: get a bike box from a local shop (often free) and ship via BikeFlights (roughly $70–120), or fly with it as checked luggage.\n- [ ] Book ground shipping for boxes (USPS Ground Advantage / UPS Ground). Ship to the incubator house address once confirmed.\n- [ ] List mattress + furniture on FB Marketplace / VT groups; schedule bulk trash pickup with the town if unsold.\n\n**1 week out**\n- [ ] Forward mail (USPS online, ~$1.10).\n- [ ] Cancel/transfer utilities and internet; return the router.\n- [ ] Notify landlord of move-out walk-through; photograph the apartment empty.\n- [ ] Update address: bank, credit cards, VT records (Grace Kim / registrar, since you're on leave), car insurance if keeping the car.\n\n**Last 2 days**\n- [ ] Pack a carry-on with laptop, chargers, docs, 3 days of clothes, running shoes.\n- [ ] Drop keys, get deposit return info in writing.\n\n**After landing**\n- [ ] CA: driver's license within 10 days of residency and car registration within 20 days if you bring a car; renter's insurance."
     ]
    },
